# Native — regenerated by `expo prebuild` / `expo run:*`. Keeping these
# OUT of git is what keeps this a managed (CNG) project, so EAS Build
# always builds fresh from app.json instead of detecting a "bare" project.
# Delete these folders locally too unless you've hand-edited native code
# you need to keep.
